{"_id":"vfM2XBUppmkBT2XO","name":"Skillsoft 8","type":"Cyberware","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Costs 1+ points. Skillsofts are purchased as set skill values as noted. They do not add to natural or career skills, nor do they accept racial or magical bonuses. The character switches to the software to perform the skill and it is not integrated into the mind or body elsewise. An equivalent amount of memory must be purchased as well. E.g. purchasing Small Arms 10 would require 4 points of Cybertechnology: Headware, 2 for the skill and 2 for the required Memory.</p>","category":{"value":"Headware"},"points":1,"isInstalled":true,"resourceCost":0},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1800,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
